text = "The armless creature lived happily ever since it got back the Antique Clock
But ever since you entered that building, something has been haunting you.
So its your job to make it stop haunting the armless creature.

The legends say that the haunting ghost only likes cookies.
But the legends also say that when a ghost goes trick or treating, everyone starts screaming, instead of giving him cookies.

So you made an agreement

You will find three cookies for the ghost and in return he won't haunt you until next Halloween

SO FIND THE THREE COOKIES"
horizontal_alignment = 1

